Short:        Removes the whitespaces from sources
Author:       szolim@dragon.klte.hu (Imre Szollosi)
Uploader:     szolim dragon klte hu (Imre Szollosi)
Type:         dev/asm
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

  This short and fast utility removes the useless whitespaces and comments
from assembly includes (and sources) for faster compiling, and
better memory usage.
  You can piping if you need it.
